# Security, Performance, And Launch Readiness

Before implementing or claiming done on security-sensitive or launch-critical work, check the relevant docs in `docs/patterns/` and fill in the matching project docs in `docs/project/`.

## Use This Rule For

- Auth, sessions, roles, or permissions
- Payments, webhooks, or billing flows
- AI endpoints, chatbots, or model integrations
- Contact forms and public form submissions
- Public APIs and server routes
- Database access, migrations, or Supabase RLS
- File uploads and user-generated content
- Production deploys, staging hardening, or launch readiness

